summary: Perform data testing of USB Storage devices
description:
    The test is primarily designed to be used manually
    due to having to be present to insert/remove the media.
    Please insert the USB device prior to starting the test.
contact: Fendy Tjahjadi <ftjahjad@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
test: bash ./runtest.sh
require:
  - python
  - git
framework: beakerlib
duration: 12m
extra-summary: hw-enablement/removable-media/USB-storage
extra-task: hw-enablement/removable-media/USB-storage
